5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I'm not really sure what to say first... but I hope we can all work together to find the werewolf. Please be kind to me.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep this efficient. @Daisuke, your nervousness is a bit too obvious. It's better to stay calm if we want to find the werewolf logically. I'll be observing everyone's reactions closely.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, such a stern start. While I agree with the need for logic, being overly aggressive might just scare the villagers into making mistakes. Let's see who actually has something useful to contribute.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It's nice to meet you all. I agree with Shunichi; let's try to keep things friendly and supportive. We'll find the werewolf much faster if we all feel comfortable talking together.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us maintain our composure and proceed with patience. I believe observing each other's words carefully will lead us to the truth in due time.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Shion... sorry. I'll try my best to stay calm. I just... I really don't want us to make a mistake and execute someone innocent. Does anyone have a plan for how we should start?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, apologies aren't necessary, but results are. Since we have no information yet, the Seer's first divination is the only variable. I suggest we focus on identifying contradictions in our behavior once the first death occurs.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're always so focused on the ""result."" It's almost robotic. While we wait for the Seer's information, I'm more interested in seeing who tries too hard to lead the conversation. It's a classic tell.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, that's an interesting perspective. But maybe some people just want to help the group move forward? Let's try not to be too suspicious of each other right away. We should trust one another for now.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"Trust is a delicate thing, Midori, but it is necessary. However, we must balance that trust with a healthy amount of caution. I shall be watching how our dynamics evolve.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with Midori. Trusting each other seems right, but George is also right about being cautious. I'm just... really worried. I hope the Seer finds something helpful tonight.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your anxiety is becoming a distraction. Trust is a sentiment, not a strategy. I'm more interested in who is attempting to manipulate the mood of the group to avoid scrutiny. @Midori, your optimism is quite convenient.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're practically begging for someone to be the villain in your little drama. Attacking Midori for being nice is a bit desperate, don't you think? You're making yourself the most unpleasant person here.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I'm sorry if my optimism seems convenient. I just believe that we'll be more effective if we support each other. Please don't be too hard on us; we're all on the same side.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,"@Shion, while your pursuit of logic is admirable, please remember that we are humans, not machines. Constant friction will only cloud our judgment. Let us all take a breath and remain patient.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope everyone can get along. @Shion, please don't be so mean to Midori. I'll try to be more helpful tomorrow... I'm sorry for being so nervous. Good luck to the Seer tonight.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your apologies are redundant. I'm not being ""mean""; I'm being analytical. If you're all content with this sentimental approach, so be it. I'll simply wait for the facts to emerge tomorrow.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, your ""analysis"" is just a mask for your lack of social grace. I'll be curious to see if your logic holds up when the first body drops. Until then, I'm quite satisfied with how this is going.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I hope we can all start tomorrow on a positive note. Let's try to be patient with one another and work together. Goodnight, everyone. I'll see you all tomorrow.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,George,,It seems we have established our initial positions. I shall retire for the evening and focus my efforts on the task at hand. Goodnight to you all; may we find clarity tomorrow.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
