35,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... good morning. I... I hope everyone slept okay. Does anyone have any information? I'm really scared that someone might have been... you know... attacked.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, stop trembling. It's inefficient. Since no one has been executed yet, the only new information comes from the Seer. @Seer, if you've found a werewolf, now is the time to speak. Otherwise, let's analyze the silence.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, still rushing into things, I see. Forcing the Seer to reveal themselves immediately is a gamble that usually only benefits the werewolf. Why not let the Seer decide the best timing for their reveal?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, I agree. It might be safer for the Seer to wait a bit so they aren't targeted right away. Let's be patient and give them space to decide how to help us.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,George,,"I agree with Shunichi and Midori. A premature reveal can be a dangerous gamble. For now, let us observe how everyone reacts to the start of the first day before we make any hasty decisions.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with George. I don't want the Seer to be in danger. But... if the Seer knows something, maybe they could give us a small hint? I'm just... really worried we'll vote for the wrong person.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, a ""small hint"" is useless and only invites the werewolf to adapt. Either the Seer provides a concrete result or we rely on behavioral analysis. @Shunichi, @Midori, @George, your collective hesitation is suspiciously synchronized.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi"",""Midori"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, your obsession with ""synchronization"" is reaching a fever pitch. We're simply agreeing on a basic strategy to protect the Seer. Are you so desperate to find a pattern that you're inventing one? It's getting a bit tedious.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, please don't be so suspicious. We're just trying to be careful for the sake of the village. If we all agree on something simple, it doesn't mean we're conspiring; it just means we're thinking logically about safety.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shion, your insistence on seeing conspiracy in every agreement is quite tiring. Logic should lead us to protect our assets, not to cast doubt on everyone who shares a reasonable opinion. Let us focus on the facts we have.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't like how everyone is arguing. @Shion, please stop accusing everyone. It makes me feel like we're already falling apart. Does anyone actually suspect someone specific, or are we just... fighting?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, fighting is merely the process of eliminating falsehoods. Since no one is stepping forward as the Seer, the werewolf is likely hiding behind this ""friendly"" consensus. @Midori, your insistence on harmony is starting to look like a shield.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're just throwing darts in the dark now. First it was the ""synchronized"" group, now it's Midori's kindness. If you keep accusing everyone without evidence, you're just making it easier for the real werewolf to hide.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, it's really sad that you see my kindness as a shield. I truly just want us to get along so we can think clearly. Why is it so hard to believe that someone can be genuinely supportive?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,George,,"@Shion, your approach is becoming counterproductive. By attacking everyone who disagrees with you, you are creating the very chaos a werewolf would desire. Let us stop this bickering and think more clearly.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I can't take the fighting anymore. It's too much. @Shion, please... if you don't have proof, why are you being so aggressive? I'm really scared we're going to vote for someone just because they're not like you.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your fear is a liability. I am not being aggressive; I am testing the boundaries of your ""trust."" If the werewolf is among us, they are the one most likely to plead for peace. I'll vote based on logic.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, your ""logic"" is nothing more than a temper tantrum disguised as analysis. You've spent the entire day attacking everyone except yourself. It's almost too obvious. I'm voting for you.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
53,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
54,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I really wish we could have found a way to understand each other. But your aggression is making it very hard for the group to feel safe. I'm sorry, but I agree with Shunichi.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
55,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
56,1,4,talk,George,,"@Shion, your refusal to cooperate with the group's emotional state has created an atmosphere of distrust. While I know you are human, your behavior is indeed disruptive. I shall follow the majority's lead.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
57,1,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
