71,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... George... I can't believe it. I'm so sorry. We just executed Shion, and now George is gone too... This is terrible. Is... is the werewolf really among us? I'm so scared...","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, take a breath. Panicking helps no one. Shion was a nuisance, and George was a gentleman, but their absence doesn't change the fact that the werewolf is still here. We need to be rational now, more than ever.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, please try to stay strong. It's heartbreaking to lose George, but we have to keep going for his sake. @Shunichi is right; we need to stay calm and focused to find the werewolf.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm trying, but it's so hard. We're only three people left. If we make one more mistake... we lose. @Shunichi, @Midori... do either of you have any information? Please, tell me if you're the Seer.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your desperation is palpable, but begging for a reveal is a dangerous game. If the Seer is still alive, they'll speak when it's strategically sound. For now, let's look at the remaining options. It's just us three.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I understand how you feel, but we must be brave. I'm not the Seer, but I'm here with you. @Shunichi, since we're the only ones left, how should we decide who to trust?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know how to decide. @Midori, you said you're not the Seer... so that means it's either me or @Shunichi. But I'm just a villager... so @Shunichi, are you the Seer? Please, just tell us!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your logic is as shaky as your voice. If Midori isn't the Seer and you claim to be a villager, you're practically handing me the win if I were the werewolf. I'm not the Seer, which means you're mistaken about something.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, please don't panic. If neither Shunichi nor I are the Seer, then the Seer must have been Shion or George. That means we have no more divinations to rely on, and we must trust our intuition.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi"",""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I see. If the Seer is gone, then we're really on our own. I trust you, Midori... but I'm so confused. @Shunichi, if you're not the Seer either, then who is the werewolf? I... I don't want to make another mistake.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
81,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your confusion is almost endearing. If we're all ""just humans,"" then the math doesn't add up. One of us is lying. Since Midori is so focused on trust, perhaps it's time we question whose trust is actually earned.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
82,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, why are you suddenly turning your suspicion toward me? I've only ever tried to keep us together. @Daisuke, please don't let him confuse you. We have to stay calm to make the right choice.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
